    <string name="about_text">I-AMARadio simahla 100% kwizibhengezo kwaye igxile kwimfihlo yakho.\n\nNdiqale ndayenza le app kumama wam ukumupha amava alula, anyanisileyo eradiyo ngaphandle kwezibhengezo ezoicaphukisayo okanye ukulandelwa. Kungenxa yoko le nto i-AMARadio iyakuhlala ingenasibhengezo – sisithembiso kuye, esabelwana nani nonke.\n\nLe phrojekthi yi-fork ye-RadioDroid. Yonke ikhowudi isuswe kwi-Java yasiwa kwi-Kotlin.\n\nIkhowudi yomthombo ifumaneka kwi: https://github.com/ounben/AMARadio\n\nLe appisebenzisa uvimba wezikhululo zeradiyo wasimahla kwi https://www.radio-browser.info .\n\nImiro eya kuxhumana: ben@ounben.com\n\nIingxaki: https://github.com/ounben/AMARadio/issues\n\nLe app yihardware ekhululekileyo phantsi kwe-GPLv3. https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html</string>
